#N canvas 20 20 2600 1300 12;
#X text 20 20 e_line -- a Pd voice's effects \, as its patch has them (Brendan \, 2026-11-06): distortion \, echo and reverb \, one set a line \, each off until it's asked for \, at its CPU cost then. ref/module/voices.md, f 58;
#X text 800 20 inlet~: the sound. inlet: tone <param> <value> \, of which it takes drive \, drive-type \, echo \, echo-time \, echo-fb \, reverb and room \, each 0 to 1 \, and leaves the rest to c_mono. outlet~: the sound with them., f 58;
#X obj 20 240 inlet~;
#X obj 800 240 inlet;
#X obj 800 290 route tone;
#X obj 800 340 route drive drive-type echo echo-time echo-fb reverb room;
